    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d699">

                <pb facs="0735" n="731" sameAs="frus:frus1939v03/pg731"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/6981</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thomas W. Lamont,
                        of J. P. Morgan &amp; Co., to the Adviser on Political Relations</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Hornbeck</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-07-31">July 31, 1939</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Dr. Hornbeok</hi>: Confirming my telephone
                    conversation with you today, I attach herewith copy of the memorandum filed a
                    week ago with the Hongkong Bank in London, to be submitted to the Head Office at
                    Hongkong. I think that probably you and I don’t see quite eye to eye on this
                    matter of the dissolution of the Consortium, but I don’t see what useful purpose
                    the maintenance of it serves. However, we shall see what we shall see.</p>
                <p>Hoping that you will have a fine holiday, I am</p>
                <p>Yours sincerely,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>T. W. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lamont</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d699-a1.xml" xpointer="d699-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
